schema.description:
Server-Sent Events stream. Each event is pushed in the format `data: {json}

`. The stream ends with a `done` event, followed by sending `data: [DONE]

`. Event types include `text_delta`, `thinking`, `tool_use`, `tool_result`, `card`, `citation`, `ask_user_question`, `artifact`, `system_message`, `compact`, `error`, `done`.
